{"id":"3628414839005ad6","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-beth-definability.md","title":"Beth's Definability Theorem","display":"Beth's Definability Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-thm-beth-definability","aliases":["93-thm-beth-definability"],"display":"Beth's Definability Theorem","depends_on":["[[93-df-first-order-language]]","[[93-df-first-order-formula]]","[[93-df-first-order-theory]]","[[93-df-implicit-definability]]","[[93-df-explicit-definability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-beth-definability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-beth-definability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Beth's Definability Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc9bc888c7dda430\" href=\"?note=cc9bc888c7dda430\" title=\"93-df-first-order-language\">93-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"84c35fea1e867240\" href=\"?note=84c35fea1e867240\" title=\"93-df-first-order-formula\">93-df-first-order-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"30a8f872911e731f\" href=\"?note=30a8f872911e731f\" title=\"93-df-first-order-theory\">93-df-first-order-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c000d6833b849019\" href=\"?note=c000d6833b849019\" title=\"93-df-implicit-definability\">93-df-implicit-definability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e9e2c1c3d7432b0\" href=\"?note=5e9e2c1c3d7432b0\" title=\"93-df-explicit-definability\">93-df-explicit-definability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-beth-definability-—-Beth's-Definability-Theorem\">thm-beth-definability — Beth's Definability Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-theory.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}\\)</span> have their sourced signatures.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ImplDef}_{93}(R,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ImplDef}_{93}(R,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExplDef}_{93}(R,\\varphi,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ExplDef}_{93}(R,\\varphi,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> have their sourced signatures.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}beth\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ImplDef}_{93}(R,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\;\n\\mathrm{ExplDef}_{93}(R,\\varphi,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}beth\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ImplDef}_{93}(R,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\;\n\\mathrm{ExplDef}_{93}(R,\\varphi,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The hypothesis must be implicit definability alone. Assuming at the outset that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\models\\forall\\bar x(R\\leftrightarrow\\varphi)\">\\(T\\models\\forall\\bar x(R\\leftrightarrow\\varphi)\\)</span> would already be explicit definability and would make the theorem circular.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-beth-definability-—-Beth's-Definability-Theorem","text":"thm-beth-definability — Beth's Definability Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"cc9bc888c7dda430","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"84c35fea1e867240","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-theory","status":"resolved","id":"30a8f872911e731f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-implicit-definability","status":"resolved","id":"c000d6833b849019","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-implicit-definability]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-explicit-definability","status":"resolved","id":"5e9e2c1c3d7432b0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-explicit-definability]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ImplDef}_{93}(R,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExplDef}_{93}(R,\\varphi,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}beth\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ImplDef}_{93}(R,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\;\n\\mathrm{ExplDef}_{93}(R,\\varphi,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)","display":true},{"tex":"T\\models\\forall\\bar x(R\\leftrightarrow\\varphi)","display":false}],"bytes":1322,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["cc9bc888c7dda430","84c35fea1e867240","30a8f872911e731f","c000d6833b849019","5e9e2c1c3d7432b0"]}